                                "sense_id": "8e062575-78d9-3740-8fc7-45839affeb72",
                                "text": "“Enough to make a man morbid, to be stalked by beastly journalists and stared at by gaping moon-faced idiots, wherever he goes! But there’s worse than that.”"
